Schedule a SequentialCommandGroup with three commands:

schedule(
                new SequentialCommandGroup(
                        new InstantCommand(() -> motor.setPower(0.5)),
                        new WaitCommand(2000),
                        new InstantCommand(() -> motor.setPower(0.0))
                )
        );

Now the order is guaranteed: start, wait 2 seconds, stop.
